          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without http:// or https://, the app tries https and then http, so a server at home works as typed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bez http:// nebo https:// aplikace zkusí https a pak http, takže server doma funguje tak, jak ho napíšete."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're offline, and none of these songs are downloaded." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jste offline a žádná z těchto skladeb není stažená."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your sign-in stays in this iPhone's Keychain. Subsonic servers get a one-time token made from the password; Jellyfin gives a token and the password isn't kept." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Přihlášení zůstává v klíčence iPhonu. Servery Subsonic dostávají jednorázový token vytvořený z hesla; Jellyfin vydá token a heslo se neukládá."
          }
        }
      }
    },
